            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "काल रात्री मुसळधार पाऊस पडला. kāl rātrī musaḷdhār pāūs paḍlā. Last night it rained in torrents."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मुसळ is a pestle and धार a stream: rain as thick as pestles."
            }
          ]
        },
