              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बरसणे — barasṇe — \"to pour down\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ढग गडगडले आणि पाऊस बरसला. ḍhag gaḍgaḍle āṇi pāūs baraslā. The clouds rumbled and the rain poured down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो बरसला, to baraslā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Rain बरसतो; it sounds more poetic than पडणे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बरसणे (barasṇe) belongs with Sanskrit varṣati, \"it rains\", where CDIAL lists Marathi varasṇẽ (CDIAL 11394); the form with b- matches Hindi barasnā, and how it reached Marathi is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
